  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7407701",
      "subQuestName": "Decode this level's puzzle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740770101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740770101": {
            "id": "740770101",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "I estimated the height of the tower, and we're almost at the bottom. We may have to face Narzissenkreuz if we continue to descend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770102"
            ]
          },
          "740770102": {
            "id": "740770102",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "The world is about to welcome its own answer. Will it be destruction or salvation? Or perhaps Narzissenkreuz's version of salvation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770103"
            ]
          },
          "740770103": {
            "id": "740770103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Please, who'd wanna escape the apocalypse their way?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770104"
            ]
          },
          "740770104": {
            "id": "740770104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#If Paimon has to leave, she'll make {NICKNAME} take her away from Teyvat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770105"
            ]
          },
          "740770105": {
            "id": "740770105",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm going to save everyone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770106"
            ]
          },
          "740770106": {
            "id": "740770106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, Paimon wasn't saying she'd just watch everyone bite the dust!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770107"
            ]
          },
          "740770107": {
            "id": "740770107",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "There aren't any riddles or pursuers here, so why don't we get some rest and prepare ourselves here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770108"
            ]
          },
          "740770108": {
            "id": "740770108",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Failing to prepare is preparing to fail.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770109"
            ]
          },
          "740770109": {
            "id": "740770109",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "Everyone, the door to the next level seems to be locked.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770110"
            ]
          },
          "740770110": {
            "id": "740770110",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "Do you require me to put my engine into overdrive to get enough horsepower to break through?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770111"
            ]
          },
          "740770111": {
            "id": "740770111",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "That won't be necessary. We've decided to rest and reorganize here anyway, so we should just be cautious and look around for a key.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770112"
            ]
          },
          "740770112": {
            "id": "740770112",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "And if we discover that it's a door without a key, then I'll kick it open myself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407702",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the lower level",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740770201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740770201": {
            "id": "740770201",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "The combat capabilities arrayed here are quite the terrifying sight...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770202"
            ]
          },
          "740770202": {
            "id": "740770202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh. You changed back, Caterpillar!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770203"
            ]
          },
          "740770203": {
            "id": "740770203",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Well, we do need to be ready for a fight, after all. Look.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770204"
            ]
          },
          "740770204": {
            "id": "740770204",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "These must be the security installations that were left behind when the tower was sealed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770205"
            ]
          },
          "740770205": {
            "id": "740770205",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "I'm afraid attempting to access the lowest level will trigger their activation sequences.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770206"
            ]
          },
          "740770206": {
            "id": "740770206",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "Your guess is correct. I've checked. These clockwork meka can indeed still be activated.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770207"
            ]
          },
          "740770207": {
            "id": "740770207",
            "speakerId": 16924,
            "speakerName": "Seymour",
            "text": "In other words, there's also a possibility that they will fail to activate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770208"
            ]
          },
          "740770208": {
            "id": "740770208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "They've been here for all these years?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770209"
            ]
          },
          "740770209": {
            "id": "740770209",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Well, this is the first time in all these years that the Holy Blade of Narzissenkreuz has been restored.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770210"
            ]
          },
          "740770210": {
            "id": "740770210",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "If the design from back then is accurate, the Holy Blade itself is the key that will open the final Seal.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770211"
            ]
          },
          "740770211": {
            "id": "740770211",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "If everyone's ready, let's get started."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407703",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the lower level",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740770301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740770301": {
            "id": "740770301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, it feels like the floor is moving...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770302"
            ]
          },
          "740770302": {
            "id": "740770302",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "It's the beginning of the end."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407707",
      "subQuestName": "Decode this level's puzzle",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740770701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740770701": {
            "id": "740770701",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "There are some of Narzissenkreuz's notes and books here. Interesting as they may be, none of them have a conclusion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770702"
            ]
          },
          "740770702": {
            "id": "740770702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Caterpillar, I have a question.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770703"
            ]
          },
          "740770703": {
            "id": "740770703",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Ask away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770704"
            ]
          },
          "740770704": {
            "id": "740770704",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "The members of the Ordo clearly hate clockwork meka...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770705"
            ]
          },
          "740770705": {
            "id": "740770705",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...So why are there so many gears in this tower?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770706"
            ]
          },
          "740770706": {
            "id": "740770706",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Now that is an interesting question. But all I can offer is my own conjecture.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770707"
            ]
          },
          "740770707": {
            "id": "740770707",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "In my opinion, the theme of this place isn't \"gears,\" but \"bells.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770708"
            ]
          },
          "740770708": {
            "id": "740770708",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "The chime of a bell holds a special meaning even for people like Jakob and Narzissenkreuz.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770709"
            ]
          },
          "740770709": {
            "id": "740770709",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "A special meaning?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740770710"
            ]
          },
          "740770710": {
            "id": "740770710",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "When the bell tolls, the world ends, the adventure is over, or you simply awaken from the dream. Who knows?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407718",
