    {
      "subId": "7407725",
      "subQuestName": "Take a break and talk with everyone",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740771201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740771201": {
            "id": "740771201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, why are people so fond of immersing themselves in dreams?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771202"
            ]
          },
          "740771202": {
            "id": "740771202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Mary-Ann weaves a dream encircling everyone, and Narzissenkreuz is living in his dream of saving the world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771203"
            ]
          },
          "740771203": {
            "id": "740771203",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And I'm the one who's worried about tomorrow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771204"
            ]
          },
          "740771204": {
            "id": "740771204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...So it's understandable if you don't understand, Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771205"
            ]
          },
          "740771205": {
            "id": "740771205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "B—Because Paimon's the type to live in the present!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771206"
            ]
          },
          "740771206": {
            "id": "740771206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But if it's a dream, you have to wake up eventually.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771207"
            ]
          },
          "740771207": {
            "id": "740771207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And there are only two things you can do after waking from a dream.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771208"
            ]
          },
          "740771208": {
            "id": "740771208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You can try to go right back to sleep and return to the same dream...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771209"
            ]
          },
          "740771209": {
            "id": "740771209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Or, you can face yourself in the waking world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771210"
            ]
          },
          "740771210": {
            "id": "740771210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And since you've woken up, it's time for breakfast. You can reward yourself with a nice Chicken-Mushroom Skewer!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771211"
            ]
          },
          "740771211": {
            "id": "740771211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It's time to wake up again, and bravely face reality for another day. You can do it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771212"
            ]
          },
          "740771212": {
            "id": "740771212",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Wait, so that really was foreshadowing!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740771213"
            ]
          },
          "740771213": {
            "id": "740771213",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Foreshadowing? What foreshadowing?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7407726",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Caterpillar",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "740772501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "740772501": {
            "id": "740772501",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "#Well, well. Guess what we have stuck between the pages, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740772502"
            ]
          },
          "740772502": {
            "id": "740772502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa! It's a key!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740772503"
            ]
          },
          "740772503": {
            "id": "740772503",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Indeed, and Seymour's already used sonic imaging to do a rough analysis. It really is the key to that door.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740772504"
            ]
          },
          "740772504": {
            "id": "740772504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If Fontaine's authorities raided this place before, why didn't they find this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740772505"
            ]
          },
          "740772505": {
            "id": "740772505",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Perhaps the answer is that it was simply never raided. Having looked through the notes here, I think I can understand why...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740772506"
            ]
          },
          "740772506": {
            "id": "740772506",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Why he simply closed the door and quietly left.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740772507"
            ]
          },
          "740772507": {
            "id": "740772507",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... What are you trying to say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740772508"
            ]
          },
          "740772508": {
            "id": "740772508",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "It's nothing. Perhaps this is enough. After all, there are clockwork meka below that may come to life at any second.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "740772509"
            ]
          },
          "740772509": {
            "id": "740772509",
            "speakerId": 21048,
            "speakerName": "Caterpillar",
            "text": "Time to go."
          }
        }
      }
    },
